r","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs from 1951 to 2025, and on the middle of the county&rsquo;s grids August to September came in under 90% of normal in 37 of those years. In 2025 that same middle put August to September at 37% of normal and September to October at 41%. So far in 2026 the middle shows January to February at 30% and March to April at 158%.</p>"}
